%
% <<Content/Activities/figures/potentiometer.png>>
%
% Applying Ohm's law, we can generate the following expression for $e_o$.
%
% $$ e_o = \frac{R_2}{R_1+R_2}e_i $$ 
%
% Since $R_1 + R_2$ is constant, the output voltage changes linearly with
