% use the IO package, refer to the following < ?aux=Activities_IOpack
% link>. The Simulink model we will use is shown below and can be
% downloaded <Content/Activities/pendulum.slx here>, where you may need
% to change the COM port in the IO Setup block to match location where your
% Arduino board is connected. This model simply reads the
% potentiometer data (pendulum angle) via an Analog Read on channel A0 and
% then displays the stored data on a scope and a display. The model also
% writes the data to the MATLAB workspace for further analysis. The Arduino
